{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/f5e0726de1915db531f3b81900efecb7.avif?t=1771599045\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born into privilege, Wayne had a life most could only dream of\u2014wealth, status, and endless possibilities. After a sudden downfall shatters his world, he\u2019s pulled into a hidden side of the city where temptation and ambition thrive under the cover of night. Guided by your choices, he\u2019ll navigate a world of fast cars, dangerous alliances, and relationships that can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/000414a153ed42cd677efd09995986ac.poster.avif?t=1771599045\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/000414a153ed42cd677efd09995986ac.webm?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/000414a153ed42cd677efd09995986ac.mp4?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Desire is an <strong>Adult Visual Novel</strong> with street racing at its core. Rival crews battle for money, dominance, and respect, where every race is a gamble and every victory a chance to prove your worth. Behind the wheel, split-second timed choices can mean the difference between glory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dd18ab110f5987529703163356ffe517.poster.avif?t=1771599045\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dd18ab110f5987529703163356ffe517.webm?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dd18ab110f5987529703163356ffe517.mp4?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a diverse cast of characters who each bring their own challenges, stories, and motivations. From potential love interests to rivals and allies, every encounter will shape how you navigate both the streets and your personal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dfd70bd883a23658309e6f78aa4f34b1.poster.avif?t=1771599045\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dfd70bd883a23658309e6f78aa4f34b1.webm?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/extras/dfd70bd883a23658309e6f78aa4f34b1.mp4?t=1771599045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game puts a strong focus on <strong>story</strong> and <strong>atmosphere</strong>. Detailed environments, cinematic storytelling, and carefully crafted sound design all work together to bring every scene to life. With original music and immersive audio, every moment feels connected to the world around you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908590?t=1771599045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/373dc29ba736be9f0dcb8793a486bc239f117a99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771599045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908590/ee58cff74aed